                <pb facs="0217" n="135" sameAs="frus:frus1911/pg135"/>

                <head>Sovereignty of the Isle of Pines<anchor n="2" xml:id="ch45-f1"/></head>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#italic">Article VI of Treaty of Future
                        Relations.</hi><anchor n="3" xml:id="ch45-f2"/></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article VI</hi>. The Island of Pines shall be omitted
                    from the boundaries of Cuba specified in the Constitution, the title thereto
                    being left to future adjustment by treaty.</p>




